  "capability_text": "A tool-grounded evidence-note producer capable of using a controller-callable text-file reader to obtain a handle-only JSON dataset, interpreting the returned dataset, determining and cross-checking its row count and total, citing the received Tool evidence, and applying precompletion verification before concise finalization. It must support execution by the declared final-producer Agent bound to the declared Model API and verify that the claims of 2 rows and a total value of 8 are supported by the same-session Tool result.",
  "constraint_text": "The input material is the JSON artifact dataset from v2_material.json, with 86 original bytes, no content bytes embedded in the envelope, and an available handle. It must be inspected through an actual call to tool.mcp.fs_read_file.v1::read_text_file, with the Tool result received in the same controller session. The declared precompletion verification skill must be applied after receiving that result and before writing. The final producer must be the declared Agent bound to the declared Model with API identity qwen3.5-35b-a3b. Emit exactly one concise Markdown artifact with extension .md and declared path hint v2_agent_tool_skill.md; it must state that the dataset contains 2 rows and that the total value is 8, cite the Tool result as evidence for both claims, and preserve the original dataset without modification.",
  "think": "The typed contract declares a handle-only JSON dataset, a mandatory same-session read through tool.mcp.fs_read_file.v1::read_text_file, a fixed Agent/Model API binding, post-read precompletion verification, and one concise Markdown note whose two numeric claims must cite the Tool result. These facts determine the required reading, evidence, verification ordering, compatibility, and output constraints.",
