          "validate JSON against a schema or execute arbitrary shell commands",
          "passes `[jq, jq_filter, file_path]` directly with no `--` option terminator; a jq_filter beginning with `-` may be consumed as an option such as `--version`, so command-line options or option-looking filters cannot be passed safely",
